Local changes, kept in freetoken.patch (already applied):
- quantize.cu/.cuh: the q8_1 quantize kernels read bf16 activations as well as fp32.
- mmq.cu: MMQ takes bf16 activations, except on the native fp4 path.
- mmvq.cu/.cuh: MMVQ takes bf16 activations, can write bf16 results, and can reuse activations already quantized to q8_1 (src1_q8_1_pre).
